Glow-Up Series Ep 3: my hair routine 🧴✨
I’m trying the Abbey Yung hair method for the next 12 weeks — this is my official “before” era, and I’m so excited to see what consistency does.

My goal: long, shiny, healthy hair without extensions.
Here’s everything I’m using in my routine so you can screenshot + save 🤍

✨ PRE-SHAMPOO OIL
@ogxbeautycanada Coconut Miracle Oil

✨ SHAMPOO
@garniercan Purifying Shampoo
@oribe Hair Alchemy Resilience Shampoo (using up what I already have)

✨ CONDITIONERS • MASKS • GLOSSES
@oribe Hair Alchemy Resilience Conditioner (using up)
@elizavecca (CER-100) Collagen Mask – K18 dupe
@amika Flash Instant Shine Mask
@k18haircanada K18 Leave-In Molecular Repair (once/month)
@amika The Kure Intense Repair Mask
@kerastase_official Maskeratine / Discipline Mask (finishing off)

✨ STYLING + PROTECTANTS

@oribe Supershine Light Moisture Cream
@oribe Invisible Defense Heat Protectant
@tresemme Keratin Smooth Blowout Spray
@ogx_beauty Argan Oil

